1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 23=

4
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,030
You're leaving me?

5
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:03,670
Your Highness.

6
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,710
The act is over.

7
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,870
It's time for me to leave the board.

8
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,870
I'm going back to Ruanhong Pavilion.

9
00:01:10,870 --> 00:01:12,310
I've given you so much money.

10
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,400
There's really no need
for you to go back there

11
00:01:14,790 --> 00:01:17,040
and spend your days
entertaining others with a smile.

12
00:01:19,590 --> 00:01:21,000
There's no such thing as too much money.

13
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:23,640
What's wrong with making others happy?

14
00:01:23,790 --> 00:01:25,310
I'll go back to being the top courtesan.

15
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,280
Someday,

16
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:29,400
I'll marry a wealthy man
who treats me well.

17
00:01:29,510 --> 00:01:31,510
For someone like me,
that's the best life I could hope for.

18
00:01:34,710 --> 00:01:35,430
Or,

19
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,790
if Your Highness would like,

20
00:01:38,710 --> 00:01:40,230
I wouldn't mind

21
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,120
becoming your concubine.

22
00:01:42,430 --> 00:01:43,230
No.

23
00:01:46,510 --> 00:01:48,120
As expected of Your Highness.

24
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,680
You truly are the most
devoted man in the world. Just now,

25
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:52,840
I was only joking.

26
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:58,140
I'll leave you and the Crown Princess

27
00:01:58,140 --> 00:01:59,120
to enjoy your life together.

28
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:01,680
Please excuse me.

29
00:02:01,810 --> 00:02:04,030
♪I've never understood♪

30
00:02:05,630 --> 00:02:07,880
♪How long♪

31
00:02:09,470 --> 00:02:11,610
♪A fleeting moment of love can last♪

32
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:15,170
♪Before sorrow sets in♪

33
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,940
(Imperial Prison)

34
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:33,520
Your Highness.

35
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:35,240
I've come to pay my respects.

36
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,150
I've been waiting for you.

37
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:42,750
Your Highness.

38
00:02:43,030 --> 00:02:44,080
So you already know.

39
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,840
You've improved in this life.

40
00:02:46,030 --> 00:02:47,520
Mu Tingting was the spy in plain sight,

41
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:49,120
while you worked in the shadows.

42
00:02:49,910 --> 00:02:51,190
At the crucial moment,

43
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,190
you made the move that brought me down.

44
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,360
Now

45
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,310
you've accomplished your grand plan.

46
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,680
Where is Imperial Preceptor Zhixuan?

47
00:02:58,240 --> 00:03:00,280
Why hasn't he come
to see an old friend like me?

48
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,680
Didn't Your Highness already find out?

49
00:03:03,430 --> 00:03:04,600
My father, Zhixuan,

50
00:03:05,030 --> 00:03:06,280
died of illness many years ago.

51
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,120
The weeds around his grave

52
00:03:08,430 --> 00:03:09,680
are already knee-high.

53
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:14,590
This cup

54
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,800
is to the Imperial Preceptor.

55
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:21,400
This thirty-fifth lifetime

56
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:24,120
was the final cycle
he forced into existence

57
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,680
at the cost of his soul.

58
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,030
So that's how it was.

59
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,680
Ever since I was a child,

60
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,080
my father would always
appear in my dreams,

61
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:38,800
telling me to become
Your Highness's study companion

62
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,310
and follow his plan

63
00:03:40,590 --> 00:03:41,710
to fulfill our great cause.

64
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,280
At first, I thought
it was utterly absurd.

65
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:45,840
But everything later came true,

66
00:03:45,870 --> 00:03:47,080
so I had no choice but to believe it.

67
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,560
Fu Yang.

68
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,190
Now that the Imperial Preceptor is dead,

69
00:03:52,310 --> 00:03:54,840
how much longer will you remain trapped
in the game he set in motion?

70
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,400
Is the throne

71
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,800
truly what your heart desires?

72
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,680
We grew up together.

73
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:13,120
I know better than anyone

74
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,980
that what you've always wanted

75
00:04:19,510 --> 00:04:21,630
was never to rule over all,

76
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:23,800
but peace throughout the realm

77
00:04:24,430 --> 00:04:25,680
and prosperity for its people.

78
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,870
You once said

79
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,120
you wanted to follow the example
of the worthy ministers of old

80
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:32,310
and help a wise ruler usher
in an age of prosperity.

81
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,310
I can't believe

82
00:04:34,390 --> 00:04:36,680
you'd now choose to destroy
everything you once stood for.

83
00:05:07,630 --> 00:05:08,510
Your Highness.

84
00:05:09,470 --> 00:05:10,310
The Crown Prince has ordered

85
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:12,510
that no one disturb the Crown Princess
while she learns the wedding rites.

86
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,120
I'm here to speak with my sister-in-law.

87
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:15,830
Since when is it
your place to interfere?

88
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:17,310
Get out at once.

89
00:05:17,690 --> 00:05:18,830
Please make it quick, Your Highness.

90
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:20,510
Don't make things difficult for me.

91
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,240
Go.

92
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,270
Your Highness.

93
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,480
Xiaoyuan.

94
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,120
What on earth is going on?

95
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,510
What's happened to my brother?

96
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,390
Father is gravely ill and unconscious,

97
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:35,000
yet he won't let
the Imperial Physicians treat him.

98
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:36,720
Boqing has been stripped
of his military command

99
00:05:37,270 --> 00:05:38,680
and will soon be executed.

100
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:40,360
But now the border

101
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,720
is under attack by a powerful enemy.

102
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,510
Everyone at court

103
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,510
is waiting for Boqing
to lead the troops against them.

104
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:46,120
What are we going to do?

105
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:46,680
Your Highness.

106
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:48,390
Do you trust me?

107
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,360
Xiaoyuan.

108
00:05:49,830 --> 00:05:50,950
If I didn't trust you,

109
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,720
why would I have come to you?

110
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:56,510
The Crown Prince and the Seventh Prince
have turned against each other,

111
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,720
but there's a reason behind it.

112
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,040
The most important thing now

113
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,310
is to rescue the Seventh Prince first.

114
00:06:00,310 --> 00:06:01,510
Otherwise, Great Yue will be in danger.

115
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,360
Your Highness.

116
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,800
I need your help.

117
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,270
Tell me.

118
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:09,560
Yun Fang.

119
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,070
You've overstepped.

120
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,470
Zhuguang.

121
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,510
Escort the Princess back
to her palace to reflect on her actions.

122
00:06:15,830 --> 00:06:16,490
Effective immediately,

123
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:18,170
prepare her for a marriage alliance
with Northern Rong.

124
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:22,070
A marriage alliance? Your Highness!

125
00:06:22,070 --> 00:06:23,120
You're sending me away?

126
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:26,730
Xiaoyuan!

127
00:06:26,740 --> 00:06:27,360
- Your Highness!
- Go!

128
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,040
Let go of me!

129
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:29,210
Your Highness!

130
00:06:29,340 --> 00:06:29,960
Princess!

131
00:06:30,270 --> 00:06:30,750
Princess!

132
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:31,310
Your Highness!

133
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,600
Xiaoyuan.

134
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,870
You look beautiful

135
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,270
in that wedding dress.

136
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,190
You don't need to worry
about anything else.

137
00:06:49,190 --> 00:06:51,510
Just be a good Crown Princess
and stay by my side.

138
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,430
Your Majesty.

139
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:02,600
Are you sending Princess Yun Fang
into a marriage alliance?

140
00:07:04,870 --> 00:07:06,270
I have already made my decision.

141
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,120
War brings suffering
and drains the treasury.

142
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,630
Trading one princess

143
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,430
for ten years of peace

144
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,720
is well worth it.

145
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:15,530
The Seventh Prince
knows the northern border well.

146
00:07:15,970 --> 00:07:17,000
If he were reinstated
to lead the troops...

147
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:17,800
Fu Yang.

148
00:07:18,630 --> 00:07:20,240
You've said too much today.

149
00:07:21,070 --> 00:07:21,920
Don't forget.

150
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:24,040
You are standing here

151
00:07:24,980 --> 00:07:26,780
only because I allowed it.

152
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:30,120
Ceding six prefectures

153
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,720
and paying a million
in annual tribute...

154
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,160
Your Majesty,

155
00:07:35,070 --> 00:07:36,800
have you considered
what the people on the northern frontier

156
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:38,800
will have to endure?

157
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,070
The people?

158
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,600
What I want is a secure realm.

159
00:07:44,190 --> 00:07:45,510
As for Zhao Boqing,

160
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:47,120
he must die.

161
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:51,190
Since you are his trusted man,

162
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,720
you will be the one

163
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,240
to see him off

164
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:57,870
on his final journey.

165
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,870
Yes.

166
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:15,000
Your Highness.

167
00:08:20,190 --> 00:08:21,870
This gold hairpin
is a Fu family heirloom.

168
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,510
Today, I offer it as my betrothal gift

169
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:24,600
and ask for your hand in marriage.

170
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,040
If you agree,

171
00:08:27,830 --> 00:08:28,800
I will risk my life

172
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,920
to stop this marriage alliance.

173
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,320
I understand

174
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,390
how you feel, Mr. Fu.

175
00:08:41,750 --> 00:08:43,080
But as for the marriage alliance,

176
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,630
I have already agreed to it.

177
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,120
I will not change my mind.

178
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,030
Your Highness.

179
00:08:51,930 --> 00:08:52,640
Why?

180
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,740
You clearly know how I feel about you...

181
00:09:00,130 --> 00:09:01,580
Why do you keep avoiding me

182
00:09:02,780 --> 00:09:04,100
without even giving me a reason?

183
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,160
Yes.

184
00:09:06,510 --> 00:09:07,840
I know how you feel.

185
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:10,200
And I feel the same way.

186
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:16,000
Ever since the flower-viewing banquet,

187
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:18,600
I've often been haunted by nightmares.

188
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,030
In those dreams,

189
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,440
you died in my arms.

190
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:30,600
Fu Yang!

191
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,910
Fu Yang!

192
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:36,440
You actually remember.

193
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:39,080
Although it was only a dream,

194
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:41,720
that dream

195
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:45,080
has haunted me day and night.

196
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,270
It felt so real.

197
00:09:47,990 --> 00:09:49,870
I don't want it to end that way.

198
00:09:50,390 --> 00:09:51,200
Fu Yang.

199
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,320
If our story

200
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,510
is destined to end in tragedy,

201
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,720
why should I draw closer to you?

202
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,870
As a princess of Great Yue,

203
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,790
if I'm destined to do something
for my country,

204
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:07,270
then I'd rather

205
00:10:08,550 --> 00:10:10,440
choose a path I can see clearly

206
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,600
and know I can follow through.

207
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,510
This time,

208
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:21,320
I want to choose for myself.

209
00:10:22,510 --> 00:10:28,700
♪Only after walking far away
did I dare look back♪

210
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:31,320
♪If loving each other
only leaves us torn♪

211
00:10:31,330 --> 00:10:31,870
Fu Yang.

212
00:10:32,150 --> 00:10:33,550
Now that the Imperial Preceptor is dead,

213
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:34,700
how much longer will you remain trapped

214
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:36,150
in the game he set in motion?

215
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,510
Is the throne

216
00:10:37,670 --> 00:10:39,390
truly what your heart desires?

217
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,200
(Even the Princess)

218
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:43,240
(is breaking free
from the fate imposed on her,)

219
00:10:43,510 --> 00:10:44,200
(forging a new path)

220
00:10:44,510 --> 00:10:46,390
(for herself and for her country.)

221
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,870
(Yet I've kept myself trapped,)

222
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,120
(bound by my father's dying wish,)

223
00:10:51,270 --> 00:10:52,360
(fighting for power and gain.)

224
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:54,790
(Is everything I've done)

225
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:56,240
(really)

226
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:59,270
(for the sake of the people?)

227
00:11:02,250 --> 00:11:02,720
My Lord.

228
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,870
It's time to see the Seventh Prince off.

229
00:11:07,550 --> 00:11:08,520
What does this mean?

230
00:11:10,050 --> 00:11:10,610
I...

231
00:11:12,790 --> 00:11:13,360
I...

232
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,630
His Majesty has given the order

233
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:24,080
to send the Seventh Prince to his death.

234
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:50,780
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

235
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,820
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

236
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:56,460
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

237
00:11:56,980 --> 00:12:01,300
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

238
00:12:01,300 --> 00:12:04,060
♪My heart has long known♪

239
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:06,500
♪We made a promise long ago♪

240
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:08,420
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

241
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:12,420
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

242
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:15,580
♪How much must I let go♪

243
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:17,580
♪For one moment♪

244
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:20,580
♪To hold each other close♪

245
00:12:20,820 --> 00:12:25,140
♪Would that be enough?♪
